  ok   h = 6: y = 13, x_5 = 26 = 2y
B. the signed coordinate (section 6)
  ok   n -> |4n + 1| maps [-5000, 5000] bijectively onto the odd numbers 1..20001
  ok   every odd m >= 1 is |4n + 1| for n = (chi_4(m) m - 1)/4 (m < 20000)
  ok   odd step m* -> 3 m* + 2, even step m* -> (m* + 1)/2 for m* = 4n + 1
  ok   product of signed labels: n * k = 4nk + n + k
  ok   tripling a count is n -> -3n - 1
  ok   the Collatz side (sign of n, 0 positive) is chi_4 of the count
  ok   with h = 4x + eps (Session266): n = eps x gives |4n + 1| = h
  ok   tripling: J(x, eps) = (3x + eps, -eps)
  ok   central-modular packet: m -> 3m + 2 eps (x odd), m -> (m + eps)/2 (x even)
    cycles: [(0, 1), (1, 3), (-1, 2), (-5, 5), (-17, 18)]
    labels: [[1], [5, 17, 9], [3, 7], [19, 55, 27, 79, 39]] and 18 labels of the cycle of -17
