  ok   1, 3, 5 are the labels of the arcs 0 -> 0, -1 -> -2, 1 -> 4
  ok   p | N iff n = -1/4; N = -1 (mod p) iff n = -1/2 (n >= 0) or n = 0 (n < 0)   (p <= 23, |n| <= 600)
  ok   argument of the series of sheet 0 (odd part of N + 1): 2n + 1 for n >= 0, the odd part of n for n < 0
  ok   fixed points: -1/2 of 3n + 1, 1/2 of 3n - 1
